          thousands of partners, improving data quality, enforcing policy
          compliance, and enabling scheduling capabilities tied to significant
          business impact.
        </p>
        <p>
          My focus extends beyond feature development to building engineering
          systems that make teams effective—CI/CD, observability, accessibility,
          and scalable front-end architecture.
        </p>
        <p>
